      "review_summary": "The PR updates three docs pages to distinguish OpenClaw code mode from Codex Code Mode, correct Codex stability wording, and link the comparison from the Codex harness and Tool Search docs.\n\nPR surface: Docs +32. Total +32 across 3 files.\n\nReproducibility: not applicable. as a runtime reproduction; this is a docs accuracy PR. The remaining blocker is reproduced from the latest CI log: `check-docs` fails because `docs/docs_map.md` is out of date.",
